{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B648A2E9","title":"Danny is judging you","entry":"Dlg_B648A2E9::entry","exit":"Dlg_B648A2E9::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_46B9D6AB","articyId":"72057645577642862","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"In this district we all help each other out. Obviously that don't make us popular with CorpSec.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In this district we all help each other out. Obviously that don't make us popular with CorpSec.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35903","byteOffset":27930368,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_1600B0F7","articyId":"72057645577642875","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"We're a kinda... well what ever name I give ya for a bunch of businesses that work together will get me exiled if I say it out loud. But us businesses... we're friends basically.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We're a kinda... well what ever name I give ya for a bunch of businesses that work together will get me exiled if I say it out loud. But us businesses... we're friends basically.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24970","byteOffset":17326984,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_811AF9B7","articyId":"72057645577642912","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"We don't want nuthin'. It's more we.... came to a conclusion about you. And I'm here to tell you how we judged you.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We don't want nuthin'. It's more we.... came to a conclusion about you. And I'm here to tell you how we judged you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40223","byteOffset":29547544,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_5B593F4F","articyId":"72057645577642933","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"We considered how much you helped others. How much you tow the line for the corps, and how much you stand up to them.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We considered how much you helped others. How much you tow the line for the corps, and how much you stand up to them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47541","byteOffset":32322784,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_5AD2B4BB","articyId":"72057821671314968","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"I think they are actually tryin' to arrest me if they can get enough evidence...","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think they are actually tryin' to arrest me if they can get enough evidence...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33897","byteOffset":20706800,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_EAD1FF6E","articyId":"72057645577642848","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"So, uh, me and some other business owners have been kinda... keeping an eye on ya.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, uh, me and some other business owners have been kinda... keeping an eye on ya.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-200.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37114","byteOffset":28382528,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_6F078E11","articyId":"72057645577642854","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What do you mean?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you mean?","TextSheVersion":"What do you mean?","TextTheyVersion":"What do you mean?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51137","byteOffset":33759432,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_03B2EBA6","articyId":"72057645577642868","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't get it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't get it.","TextSheVersion":"I don't get it.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't get it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28116","byteOffset":18520304,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_84C73C6D","articyId":"72057645577642882","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So what do you need?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So what do you need?","TextSheVersion":"So what do you need?","TextTheyVersion":"So what do you need?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44929","byteOffset":31330992,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_50012C73","articyId":"72057645577642905","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And you want me to do ... what?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And you want me to do ... what?","TextSheVersion":"And you want me to do ... what?","TextTheyVersion":"And you want me to do ... what?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49619","byteOffset":33114288,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_C273915C","articyId":"72057645577642919","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How YOU judged ME?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How YOU judged ME?","TextSheVersion":"How YOU judged ME?","TextTheyVersion":"How YOU judged ME?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31795","byteOffset":19908528,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_E34EE102","articyId":"72057645577642926","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright... go on.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright... go on.","TextSheVersion":"Alright... go on.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright... go on."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51802","byteOffset":34013528,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_97385B0E","articyId":"72057645577642941","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And?","TextSheVersion":"And?","TextTheyVersion":"And?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43626","byteOffset":30833032,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_DDE9A53A","articyId":"72057645577642948","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"It's good news pal! At almost every turn, you've chosen to help others over obeying corporate rule.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's good news pal! At almost every turn, you've chosen to help others over obeying corporate rule.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44740","byteOffset":31259472,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_9CBBA854","articyId":"72057645577642954","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"It's good news pal! You ain't always kind or friendly, but when the chips are down, you've chosen to help others over obeying corporate rule.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's good news pal! You ain't always kind or friendly, but when the chips are down, you've chosen to help others over obeying corporate rule.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27053","byteOffset":18113960,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_F3EF501B","articyId":"72057645577642960","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"It ain't good pal. At almost every turn, you've chosen to follow the corporate path.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It ain't good pal. At almost every turn, you've chosen to follow the corporate path.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18676","byteOffset":14952080,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_56DC8E9F","articyId":"72057645577642987","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That's me alright.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's me alright.","TextSheVersion":"That's me alright.","TextTheyVersion":"That's me alright."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23754","byteOffset":16868104,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_EE9BB142","articyId":"72057645577642993","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not that bad.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not that bad.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not that bad.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not that bad."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":1025.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47604","byteOffset":32347136,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_2B122C42","articyId":"72057645577642999","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"If I wasn't so worried about you screwing us all over, I might be impressed. Look... no one is irredeemable. You can turn it around.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I wasn't so worried about you screwing us all over, I might be impressed. Look... no one is irredeemable. You can turn it around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5200.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24105","byteOffset":16998656,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_D2EEEA48","articyId":"72057645577643023","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"We all write our stories pal. You just gotta decide if this is how you want to be known, and remembered. And if not, you gotta write yourself a new ending.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We all write our stories pal. You just gotta decide if this is how you want to be known, and remembered. And if not, you gotta write yourself a new ending.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6400.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36448","byteOffset":28133832,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_5C49B4AB","articyId":"72057645577643032","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Thanks Danny.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks Danny.","TextSheVersion":"Thanks Danny.","TextTheyVersion":"Thanks Danny."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40956","byteOffset":29821640,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_5FD46CB3","articyId":"72057645577643040","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"We all write our own stories pal. You're might have a good ending, fuck, it might end up being some tragedy.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We all write our own stories pal. You're might have a good ending, fuck, it might end up being some tragedy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5800.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20291","byteOffset":15560768,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_7DEA969B","articyId":"72057606922841933","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"I mean you're not perfect, and you still make the odd questionable choice, but we recognise all you've done to help this district during a hard time.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I mean you're not perfect, and you still make the odd questionable choice, but we recognise all you've done to help this district during a hard time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5200.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18919","byteOffset":15044856,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_C231DC07","articyId":"72057606922841950","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"But if you keep goin' how you're goin' the very least people are gonna say about you is that you tried your best to help folk. And they won't forget that. I won't forget that.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But if you keep goin' how you're goin' the very least people are gonna say about you is that you tried your best to help folk. And they won't forget that. I won't forget that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6100.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36533","byteOffset":28166248,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_81DE8E52","articyId":"72057821671314956","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds serious.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds serious.","TextSheVersion":"Sounds serious.","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds serious."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45876","byteOffset":31687680,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_FA099A06","articyId":"72057821671314962","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I hate the corps.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hate the corps.","TextSheVersion":"I hate the corps.","TextTheyVersion":"I hate the corps."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49471","byteOffset":33058360,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_88AF0B99","articyId":"72057821671314979","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Evidence for what?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Evidence for what?","TextSheVersion":"Evidence for what?","TextTheyVersion":"Evidence for what?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23737","byteOffset":16861576,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_DD57D930","articyId":"72057821671314986","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"And most important of all, were you climbing on top of us to get to the top, or helping lift us all up?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And most important of all, were you climbing on top of us to get to the top, or helping lift us all up?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17795","byteOffset":14619528,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_AEB92600","articyId":"72057821671314994","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This is going to be interesting.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is going to be interesting.","TextSheVersion":"This is going to be interesting.","TextTheyVersion":"This is going to be interesting."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19556","byteOffset":15282248,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_BB8A02AC","articyId":"72057821671315001","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"You're helpful, kind, community-minded, and you're willing to compromise on your own goals to raise up your neighbors.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're helpful, kind, community-minded, and you're willing to compromise on your own goals to raise up your neighbors.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33725","byteOffset":20642976,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_35F9A441","articyId":"72057821671315008","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Wow, that's me?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wow, that's me?","TextSheVersion":"Wow, that's me?","TextTheyVersion":"Wow, that's me?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24519","byteOffset":17152720,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_CA861CE4","articyId":"72057821671315015","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You must mean someone else.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You must mean someone else.","TextSheVersion":"You must mean someone else.","TextTheyVersion":"You must mean someone else."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33220","byteOffset":20452800,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_44DBCA58","articyId":"72057821671315024","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"You're helpful, kind, community-minded, and you're willing to compromise on your own goals to raise up your neighbors.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're helpful, kind, community-minded, and you're willing to compromise on your own goals to raise up your neighbors.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31287","byteOffset":19717248,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_08C2F463","articyId":"72057821671315032","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Ok?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok?","TextSheVersion":"Ok?","TextTheyVersion":"Ok?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16765","byteOffset":14236200,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_E03BB1B4","articyId":"72057821671315040","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"You're competitive, ruthless, uncompromising, and willing to destroy any obstacle - or anyone - in your path.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're competitive, ruthless, uncompromising, and willing to destroy any obstacle - or anyone - in your path.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37560","byteOffset":28547176,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_C7DCDAA4","articyId":"72057821671315049","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Point is, at this stage in your career, your a cutthroat corporate bastard. You should think about whether that's what you want to be.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Point is, at this stage in your career, your a cutthroat corporate bastard. You should think about whether that's what you want to be.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","d